{"4918650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Brave Hearts II: False Skies", "steam_appid": 4918650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies once more, fight new drone threats, and become a Brave Heart once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four years after the Cruabar War, peace was supposed to hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, the skies are changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unidentified autonomous drones begin appearing across former war zones and civilian airspace; highly advanced, coordinated, and hostile on sight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly assigned Brave Heart pilot, you are thrust into active duty alongside an elite squadron tasked with protecting Uflein’s airspace and uncovering the origin of this growing threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as routine recon missions quickly escalates into full-scale aerial combat operations, as evidence points toward a hidden force manufacturing and deploying these machines across the region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>fully voice-acted story campaign </strong>spanning 3+ hours, featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 visual novel styled cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven mission progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-intensity dogfights and boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game QTE moments and dynamic combat sequences</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission pushes your skills, your coordination, and your squad further into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your teammate and adapt your combat style with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique teammates, each with special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic ability cooldowns and synergy in combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squad isn’t just backup, they’re the difference between survival and failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced arcade-style top-down aerial combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 aircraft to unlock and fly, including variants and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 powerful combat pickups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of maps and environmental conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel, ammo, and heat management systems for tactical depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation Points system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Mission Choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign Mode – Fully voiced narrative experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training Mode – Learn flight systems and combat basics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore Mode – Increased enemy aggression and challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FreePlay Mode – Practice combat freely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode – Survive escalating waves of drone attacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Systems &amp; Extras</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game database covering aircraft, enemies, characters, and lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to unlock as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jukebox mode to listen to the full soundtrack anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movie browser to replay any cutscene f